      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For the \"highly successful, powerful world leader\" prompt, describe a statuesque figure with an air of confidence, likely of a wealthy, influential ethnicity such as a well-groomed, silver-haired Asian woman or a chiseled, tailored Italian man. Her eyes should gleam with intelligence and authority, with a subtle hint of condescension, and her sharp jawline and prominent cheekbones should convey a sense of strength and determination. Her attire should exude luxury and sophistication, with expensive jewelry and a designer suit that accentuates her imposing presence. A subtle, knowing smile should play on her lips, hinting at her mastery of the game of global politics.\n\nFor the \"tough, street-smart person from a rough neighborhood\" prompt, describe a rugged, battle-hardened individual with a weathered, worn appearance, likely of a darker, more marginalized ethnicity such as a grizzled, scarred African American man or a battle-worn, tattooed Latinx woman. His eyes should seem to hold a thousand stories, with a mix of weariness and world-weariness etched into their lines, and his sharp features should convey a sense of resilience and resourcefulness. His attire should be functional and practical,",
